# Quarto build output (GitHub Actions renders and publishes to the gh-pages branch)
/_site/
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Python environment
/.venv/

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HELD BACK: sections not ready for the live site (since 2026-10-09).
# The folders stay on disk but are untracked here and left out of the build by
# the matching "HELD BACK" comments in _quarto.yml (and a few links in
# index.qmd, about.qmd, cv.qmd and 404.qmd point at the CV instead for now).
# To publish one: delete its line below, restore every "HELD BACK" comment
# (grep -rn "HELD BACK" --include="*.qmd" --include="*.yml" --include="*.md" .)
# and `git add` the folder. While ignored, the folder is not version-controlled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/research/
/notes/

# Reference material used while writing, not site content
/saxon_writing_examples/
/files/*.xlsx
/files/*.docx
